267867883825", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75355155_2058267871217158_4433956077496929118_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ziOT8LHbCoYQ7kNvwF9Ja05&_nc_oc=AdmIlm5XrwitUPbnIbccIJSJPjmXigVMshNmBVp37H1mjmuDDaA8Y9nByFP3Kpf3NFE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvOLMAqWP1Q2GW1b5jhLwaHh8Oz2USY2Nq5tQoTvADXjg&oe=69A6EAE9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Law Of Mass_Landscape.png", "id": "307524965152422", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429290_307524971819088_6560876650428011451_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2UgCqAG3aogQ7kNvwHxYjk_&_nc_oc=AdnNscV6c_PBjcGU5B8pbQvrf_t48XuCjZrNXHGUypZr4cWTkGkbuJoaovqdfum3qe0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afui1E7zSLG7g1zR3HAXFKwNNViI2MJC7YZ2Kwi7G7p9BQ&oe=69A6EF76"}, "display_name": "Law Of Mass Experiment - ContentsDa Science Experiment", "keywords": ["experiment", "chemistry", "mass", "science", "contentsda"], "long_description": "1. take out the vivarium box\n2. place the vivariums on the four scales on both arms\n3. place a glass tube on the right two-armed scale\n4. shrink down and enter the portal to the right side of the left scale\n5. make a fire\n6. go outside through the portal \n7. observe the left scale from outside.\n8. enter the open portal to the right\n9. start a fire\n10. use the portal to go outside.\n11. go outside and observe the scales on both arms\n<Result \n- Burning wood, charcoal, and candles: Burning wood, charcoal, and candles produces water vapor and carbon dioxide.", "short_description": "Explore the fundamental principle of mass conservation in chemical reactions. This experiment demonstrates that the mass of reactants equals the mass of products, a cornerstone concept in chemistry."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.c